# CC5 sets the glide time (the knob follows); legato notes slide, detached ones jump
wait 200
tap LFO
midi B0 05 40
wait 40
expect par10 50
expect dirty 0
midi B0 02 7F
midi 90 3C 64
wait 20
expect note 6000
midi 90 48 64
wait 250
expect note >6500
expect note <6700
wait 300
expect note 7200
shot glide.png
midi 80 48 00
midi 80 3C 00
wait 50
midi 90 30 64
wait 5
expect note 4800
midi 80 30 00
# Glide on: Always, from the Pitch page: now a detached note slides too
spin K4 1
expect par11 1
midi 90 3C 64
wait 250
expect note >5300
expect note <5500
midi 80 3C 00
wait 100
